---
import ConferenceLayout from '../../layouts/ConferenceLayout.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/url';
---

<ConferenceLayout
  title="Venue & info"
  description="Venue, transport and access information for VUEESC × GESSS 2026 at the McCoy Building, University of Melbourne."
>
  <p class="eyebrow">Venue & info</p>
  <h1>Getting there</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    VUEESC × GESSS 2026 is on Level 2 of the McCoy Building at the University of Melbourne's
    Parkville campus, on Thursday 5 and Friday 6 November.
  </p>

  <h2>Venue</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>McCoy Building, Level 2</strong><br />
    School of Geography, Earth and Atmospheric Sciences<br />
    University of Melbourne, Parkville VIC 3010
  </p>

  <h2>Transport</h2>
  <p>
    The Parkville campus is a short tram ride from the Melbourne CBD. Trams 1, 3, 5, 6, 16, 64,
    67 and 72 run along Swanston Street to the University of Melbourne stop. The closest train
    stations are Parkville and Melbourne Central.
  </p>

  <h2>Accessibility</h2>
  <p>
    If you have specific access requirements, please contact the organising committee before
    the conference so we can help.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    VUEESC × GESSS 2026 is hosted by ESPG. You can reach the organising committee through the
    <a href={url('/about')}>ESPG committee page</a>.
  </p>
</ConferenceLayout>
